IVW-MR analysis provides added support for a poten­ tial protective effect of MTOR and ARNTL against the development of UC with arthropathy, while also indicat­ ing KRAS and RPSA as potential risk factors.
## SMR analysis of circadian clock genome-wide cis-pQTLs and outcomes
Only 19 hypothesized circadian rhythm-related SNPs were retrieved from cis-pQTLs, and based on our rec­ ommended threshold following the SMR analysis, no causal connection was discovered. One explanation could be that the pQTL datasets are not fully established and only a small number of genetic variants that are strongly related with protein levels were found.
